(BiasLens is an end-to-end AI resume evaluation and editing platform. It solves a two-sided problem: \(1\) candidates lose job) Tj
T* (opportunities because automated filters penalize biased terms or missing keywords, and \(2\) recruiters unknowingly use biased) Tj
T* (screening criteria. BiasLens neutralizes demographic and behavioral bias while simultaneously optimizing the resume for) Tj
T* (enterprise Applicant Tracking Systems \(ATS\) using Google's XYZ accomplishment formula.) Tj
